{"path":"iterator/ostreambuf_iterator/operator=","title":"std::ostreambuf_iterator<CharT,Traits>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ostreambuf_iterator&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/ostreambuf_iterator/operator=","section":"iterator","kind":"page","summary":"If failed() returns false, inserts the character c into the associated stream buffer by calling pbuf->sputc(c), where pbuf is the private member of type streambuf_type*.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ostreambuf_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> CharT c <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <span class=\"t-lc\">failed()</span> returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>, inserts the character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code> into the associated stream buffer by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pbuf<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>sputc<span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <code>pbuf</code> is the private member of type <code>streambuf_type*</code>. Otherwise, does nothing.\n</p><p>If the call to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pbuf<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>sputc<span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">Traits<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">eof</span></span></code>, sets the failed() flag to true.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> c\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the character to insert\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_streambuf/sputc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sputc</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  writes one character to the put area and advances the next pointer <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_streambuf&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"iterator","title":"Iterator library"},{"path":"iterator/ostreambuf_iterator","title":"std::ostreambuf_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ostreambuf_iterator<CharT,Traits>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. If failed() returns false, inserts the character c into the associated stream buffer by calling pbuf->sputc(c), where…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"c"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"sputc","note":"writes one character to the put area and advances the next pointer"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":83,"codeBlockCount":0}
